      "description": "Free model variants have request caps and upstream capacity limits. Inspect your account quota before starting a workload.",
      "content": "## Scope\nFree variants are not unlimited access to every model. Account budgets, free-request quotas and upstream capacity are separate constraints.\n## Start safely\n1. Select a free variant in the model catalog and inspect its pricing.\n2. Create a dedicated server-side API key.\n3. Send a short, non-sensitive test request before starting an automated workflow.\n4. Inspect free_model_daily_requests via GET /api/v1/key for your daily counter and ceiling.\n## Practical choice\nUse it to compare models and prototype. Handle quota exhaustion separately from upstream capacity errors. Check Retry-After before retrying a 429, and keep a budget cap on any paid fallback.\n## Evidence\nThis is a public-document review, not an account-level benchmark."
