      "content": "## What is free\n[Doubao’s announcement](https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5368723595591761.html) describes an invite-only public beta that started on November 24, 2026. Accepted invitations include free in-app credits. Check your app for the amount, expiry and available features.\n\n## Where to look\n1. Open the [community invite tracker](https://freetokenbox.com/xiaodou-codes) and check recent posts for publicly shared codes.\n2. Confirm the source post and try the code in the Xiaodou app. Community availability labels are estimates and codes may already have been used.\n3. If needed, search for Xiaodou by Doubao in your device’s app store. Enter account details and invite codes inside the app.\n\n## Evidence\nFreeTokenBox checked the beta announcement and the community tracker on November 25, 2026. FreeTokenBox hosts the tracker using public community data. Code validity is determined by the app."
