    "name": "Meshy：每月 100 积分，免费下载限基础模型",
    "description": "网页免费层每月 100 积分；每月可下载 10 个未贴图 Meshy 6 Lite 模型，商用需按 CC BY 4.0 署名。",
    "content": "## 免费额度与重置\nMeshy 网页免费层提供每月 100 积分，无需信用卡。每月 1 日 UTC 00:00 重置，未用积分不结转。积分是生成预算，不等于可以下载 100 个模型。\n## 获取步骤\n1. 注册并进入 Meshy 网页工作区，检查 Free 方案与本月积分。\n2. 如果目标是免费导出，先选择 Meshy 6 Lite，并保持模型未贴图。\n3. 用一张自己有使用权的物品照片或简短描述生成，检查几何结果后再下载。\n4. 下载前查看模型所用版本、贴图状态和剩余下载次数，避免做完后才发现需要订阅。\n## 下载与商用\n免费层每月提供 10 次未贴图 Meshy 6 Lite 模型下载，同样在每月 1 日 UTC 00:00 重置。Meshy 6、Meshy 7、T2.5、贴图模型和 3D Agent 模型不在此范围。购买积分本身不解锁订阅下载权益。免费作品使用 CC BY 4.0，可以商用，但需要署名 Meshy。免费层仅适用于网页，不含 API 访问。\n## 适用建议\n适合低成本验证物体轮廓、学习 Blender 工作流和制作基础原型。需要贴图、特定模型版本、私有资产或无署名交付时，应先核算付费权益。\n## 官方来源\n[免费层明细](https://help.meshy.ai/en/articles/15696428-what-is-included-on-the-free-plan)、[下载限制](https://help.meshy.ai/en/articles/10421033-why-can-t-i-download-my-model)、[定价说明](https://docs.meshy.ai/en/webapp/pricing)。本页核查公开文档，未登录账户生成实测。",
    "en": {
      "name": "Meshy: 100 monthly credits with limited free downloads",
      "description": "The web tier includes 100 credits/month and 10 untextured Meshy 6 Lite downloads. Commercial use requires CC BY 4.0 attribution.",
      "content": "## Allowance\nThe free web tier includes 100 credits/month without a credit card. Credits reset at 00:00 UTC on the first day of each month and do not roll over.\n## Getting started\nCreate an account and inspect the Free balance. For a free export, choose Meshy 6 Lite and leave the model untextured. Generate a simple object, inspect its geometry and check the download counter before continuing.\n## Downloads and commercial use\nOnly 10 untextured Meshy 6 Lite downloads per month are included. Meshy 6/7, T2.5, textured assets and 3D Agent outputs require a subscription to download. Buying credits does not unlock subscription download rights. Free outputs use CC BY 4.0: commercial use is permitted with Meshy attribution. API access is excluded.\n## Best fit\nUseful for basic shapes, Blender practice and prototypes. Check paid rights before promising textured or attribution-free deliverables.\n## Sources\n[Free plan](https://help.meshy.ai/en/articles/15696428-what-is-included-on-the-free-plan), [download rules](https://help.meshy.ai/en/articles/10421033-why-can-t-i-download-my-model), [pricing](https://docs.meshy.ai/en/webapp/pricing). Public documentation review; no account-level generation test."
    },
