    "name": "Runway：一次性 125 积分的视频试用",
    "description": "免费账户有一次性 125 积分，不刷新也不过期；免费生成视频有水印，可用模型以账户界面为准。",
    "content": "## 免费额度\nRunway Free 提供一次性 125 积分和 5 GB 素材存储。积分不会过期，但用完不会按月或按天补充。官方未承诺免费层永久包含某个模型，看到升级提示的工具可能不属于当前免费方案。\n## 获取步骤\n1. 注册免费账户，先检查积分余额和可用模型。\n2. 选择一个当前可用的视频工具，使用自己的图片或简短提示词。\n3. 开始前核对分辨率、时长和积分预算，不用固定“可生成多少秒”估算所有模型。\n4. 生成后检查画面和水印，再下载适合用途的版本。\n## 水印、商用与 API\n免费生成的视频带 Runway 水印。官方 Usage rights 页面说明用户保留生成内容的权利，可以商用，不要求额外署名；仍应确保输入素材和人物肖像具有相应授权。免费方案不能购买额外积分，继续使用需要升级。此处核实的是网页/应用方案，不能推断开发者 API 也获得 125 积分。\n## 适用建议\n适合比较视频生成效果、验证镜头运动和制作一次性概念演示。需要持续月度产出或无水印交付时，先检查订阅成本。\n## 官方来源\n[免费方案](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/50404627334547-Free-plan-details)、[积分规则](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/15124877443219-How-do-credits-work)、[作品使用权](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/18927776141715-Usage-rights)。本页为公开文档核查。",
    "en": {
      "name": "Runway: a one-time 125-credit video trial",
      "description": "Free accounts receive 125 credits that never expire or renew. Free videos have a watermark; available models can change.",
      "content": "## Allowance\nFree includes a one-time 125 credits and 5 GB storage. Credits never expire but do not renew. The selection of free models can change.\n## Getting started\nRegister, check the balance and choose a currently included tool. Review the displayed cost for your model, resolution and duration before generating. Inspect the result and watermark before downloading.\n## Watermark and commercial rights\nFree videos carry a Runway watermark. The official usage-rights page permits commercial use and requires no attribution, subject to rights in your inputs. Free accounts cannot buy more credits without upgrading. The web allowance does not establish an API grant.\n## Best fit\nA limited evaluation of motion and visual quality, or a one-off concept clip. Check subscription costs for recurring output or watermark-free delivery.\n## Sources\n[Free plan](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/50404627334547-Free-plan-details), [credits](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/15124877443219-How-do-credits-work), [usage rights](https://help.runwayml.com/hc/en-us/articles/18927776141715-Usage-rights). Public documentation review, not a live generation test."
    },
