    "name": "Luma Dream Machine：有限免费草稿视频",
    "description": "官方提供有限月度积分的 Draft Mode 视频体验，未公开统一数额；免费用途和 API 计费需分开看。",
    "content": "## 免费范围\n官方 Ray3 FAQ 明确，免费账户可以使用有限月度积分体验 Draft Mode 视频生成。公开页面未给出可靠的人人通用积分数额，因此本页不写“每月多少个视频”。较新的 Agents FAQ 也提供免费体验说明，但未量化试用额度。\n## 获取步骤\n1. 进入 Dream Machine 注册账户，查看当前免费工具和可用积分。\n2. 选择免费账户当前开放的 Draft Mode，先试一个短镜头。\n3. 每次生成前检查模型、输出规格和预计消耗；不要把草稿权限当成全分辨率生成权限。\n4. 在账户页面确认剩余额度和是否启用了额外付费预算。\n## 下载、商用和 API\n官方支付指南将免费方案定位为个人项目体验，列出带水印的 720p 图片及 Ray3.14 草稿分辨率视频。不同模型的下载规格以当前界面为准；本页不承诺无水印或商业授权。Dream Machine 订阅与 API 是独立计费，积分不能相互转移，月度积分不结转。\n## 适用建议\n适合用低成本草稿验证构图、运动和镜头方向。需要商用成片前，应重新检查当前方案的许可和导出规格。\n## 官方来源\n[Ray3 FAQ](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/ray3-faqs)、[支付与订阅](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/payments-subscriptions)、[积分系统](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/dream-machine-credit-system)、[Agents FAQ](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/frequently-asked-questions-about-the-new-luma-agents-app)。仅核查公开资料，未领取额度实测。",
    "en": {
      "name": "Luma Dream Machine: limited free draft video access",
      "description": "Official documentation offers limited monthly Draft Mode credits without a reliable universal number. Web and API billing are separate.",
      "content": "## Free access\nThe Ray3 FAQ confirms limited monthly credits for free Draft Mode video generation. A newer Agents FAQ also offers a free trial without specifying its size. No universal credit or video count is claimed here.\n## Getting started\nRegister, inspect the current free tools and balance, then try a short draft. Check the selected model, output specification and estimated cost before each generation. Inspect any optional paid spending setting.\n## Output and rights\nThe payment guide positions Free for personal projects, describing watermarked 720p images and draft-resolution Ray3.14 video. Current download options depend on the model and account. Do not assume watermark-free output or commercial permission. Dream Machine subscriptions and API credits are separate and cannot be transferred; monthly credits do not roll over.\n## Best fit\nTesting composition, motion and shot direction before committing to final production.\n## Sources\n[Ray3 FAQ](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/ray3-faqs), [payments](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/payments-subscriptions), [credits](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/dream-machine-credit-system), [Agents FAQ](https://lumalabs.ai/learning-hub/frequently-asked-questions-about-the-new-luma-agents-app). Public-source review; no grant was redeemed."
    },
