    "name": "Hailuo AI：新用户一次性视频积分",
    "description": "官方条款提供新用户欢迎积分，发放后 3 天过期；额度数量随活动确认，免费视频下载有水印。",
    "content": "## 免费资格与有效期\nHailuo AI Video 订阅服务条款说明，2025 年 6 月 18 日及之后注册的新用户可获得一次性欢迎积分，每人限一份，发放后 3 天过期。条款没有写统一的积分数量，具体活动以产品显示为准，不沿用旧教程中的每日或注册积分数额。\n## 获取步骤\n1. 从 Hailuo 官网注册，先查看是否符合新用户欢迎活动。\n2. 立即检查积分发放时间、有效期和当前模型的生成消耗。\n3. 在过期前用自有图片或提示词尝试一个短视频，先确认镜头需求再消耗剩余额度。\n4. 下载前检查视频水印，避免将体验成果误当作付费成片规格。\n## 下载与商用\n免费用户下载包含水印。条款明确说明付费订阅期间生成并下载内容的商业使用权，但没有在同一条款中明确赋予免费作品相同许可，因此本页不承诺免费成片可商用。这里核实的是消费者网页/应用活动，未核实开发者 API 的免费资格。\n## 适用建议\n适合在短时间内比较图生视频、运动连贯性和不同提示词。欢迎积分有效期很短，不适合先注册后长期搁置。\n## 官方来源\n[Hailuo AI Video 订阅服务条款](https://hailuoai.video/doc/payment-policy.html)第 2、7、8、9 节。本文仅核查公开条款，没有注册或调用实测；欢迎活动是否仍向具体账户发放应先查看产品提示。",
    "en": {
      "name": "Hailuo AI: one-time welcome video credits",
      "description": "New-user welcome credits expire three days after issue. The amount depends on the current offer, and free downloads carry a watermark.",
      "content": "## Eligibility and expiry\nThe subscription terms offer a one-time welcome package to accounts registered on or after June 18, 2025, limited to one per user. Credits expire three days after issue. The terms do not specify a universal amount; inspect the current product offer.\n## Getting started\nRegister through the official site, confirm eligibility and check the issue time, expiry and generation cost. Try a short clip with your own material before committing the remaining balance.\n## Downloads and rights\nFree downloads include a watermark. The terms explicitly describe commercial rights for content generated and downloaded during a paid subscription; equivalent rights for free output are not established here. This consumer offer does not establish API credits.\n## Best fit\nA short evaluation of image-to-video and motion consistency. Do not claim a recurring daily allowance or leave welcome credits unused for weeks.\n## Source\n[Subscription terms](https://hailuoai.video/doc/payment-policy.html), sections 2 and 7–9. Public terms reviewed; registration and credit redemption were not tested. Confirm whether the current promotion applies to your account."
    },
    "source": "https://hailuoai.video/doc/payment-policy.html",
