      "name": "Fish Audio: temporary free S2.1 Pro API",
      "description": "The s2.1-pro-free promotion currently runs through November 30, 2026, without a card and subject to Fair Use.",
      "content": "## Scope and limits\nThe s2.1-pro-free promotion currently runs through November 30, 2026, without a card and subject to Fair Use.\nThis is a dated promotion, not permanent unlimited access. There is no hard character cap, but throttling is possible; no SLA or latency guarantee applies and requests may improve models. Some commercial scenarios are restricted; products above $1M ARR should contact Fish Audio. Consumer credits are separate.\n## Suggested workflow\nConfirm the promotion is active, create a key and use the exact s2.1-pro-free model name. Send a short non-sensitive sentence first and inspect its audio format. Handle throttling and promotion expiry explicitly instead of silently falling back to a paid model.\n## Official references\n[Source 1](https://fish.audio/blog/s2-1-pro-free-api/), [Source 2](https://fish.audio/developers/), [Source 3](https://fish.audio/ai-voice-generator/). Public-document review, not an account or generation test."
